<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <link rel="icon" href="/static/favicon.webp" type="image/webp">
    <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/static/apple-touch-icon.png">
    <link rel="manifest" href="/static/site.webmanifest">
    
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>運営・役職メンバー一覧 - talk-ch トークちゃんねる</title>

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

    <script>
        (function() {
            var saved = localStorage.getItem('talk_ch_theme');
            if (saved === 'light') {
                document.documentElement.setAttribute('data-theme', 'light');
            }
        })();
    </script>

    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-base: #0b0f19;
            --bg-surface: #111827;
            --border-subtle: #243046;
            --text-primary: #f8fafc;
            --text-secondary: #94a3b8;
            --text-muted: #64748b;
            --accent-primary: #38bdf8;
        }

        html[data-theme="light"] {
            --bg-base: #f1f5f9;
            --bg-surface: #ffffff;
            --border-subtle: #e2e8f0;
            --text-primary: #0f172a;
            --text-secondary: #475569;
            --text-muted: #94a3b8;
            --accent-primary: #0284c7;
        }

        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        body {
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Noto Sans JP', sans-serif;
            background: var(--bg-base);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            padding: 24px 16px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 760px;
        }

        .top-nav {
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .top-nav a {
            color: var(--accent-primary);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .panel {
            background: var(--bg-surface);
            border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            border-radius: 14px;
            padding: 28px;
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 22px;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
            padding-bottom: 12px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
        }

        .sub-desc {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-secondary);
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .table-wrap {
            overflow-x: auto;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        th {
            text-align: left;
            padding: 12px 10px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border-subtle);
            color: var(--text-primary);
            font-weight: 700;
        }

        td {
            padding: 14px 10px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
            vertical-align: middle;
        }

        .role-badge {
            font-weight: 700;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 4px;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            border-radius: 6px;
            font-size: 12px;
            white-space: nowrap;
        }

        .role-admin {
            background: rgba(239, 68, 68, 0.15);
            color: #ef4444;
        }

        .role-pr {
            background: rgba(16, 185, 129, 0.15);
            color: #10b981;
        }

        .role-box {
            background: rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.15);
            color: #38bdf8;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="container">
        <div class="top-nav">
            <a href="/">← talk-ch掲示板に戻る</a>
        </div>

        <div class="panel">
            <h1>🛡️ 運営・役職メンバー一覧</h1>
            <p class="sub-desc">
                talk-ch トークちゃんねるの運営・維持や広報に協力してくれている頼もしいメンバーの一覧です。
            </p>

            <div class="table-wrap">
                <table>
                    <thead>
                        <tr>
                            <th style="width: 30%;">役職</th>
                            <th style="width: 30%;">名前</th>
                            <th style="width: 40%;">主な活動内容</th>
                        </tr>
                    </thead>
                    <tbody>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-admin">👨‍💻 管理人★</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">ペンギン★</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">サイトの構築・開発、サーバー管理全般</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-admin">副管理人・会計</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">Mino★</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">管理人の補佐、会計作業</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-pr">📣 公式広報部長</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">🦅熟した鷹3an</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">広報部長、外部への宣伝、イベントの告知</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-pr">📣 公式広報</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">タウ</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">公式垢の運営、外部宣伝・告知</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-box">提案収集長</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">車エビ</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">掲示板の要望・提案まとめ、発展への貢献</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-box">巡回警備</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">名有り</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">掲示板内の定期巡回・不適切投稿の監視</td>
                        </tr>
                        <tr>
                            <td><span class="role-badge role-box">ログ編纂係</span></td>
                            <td style="font-weight: bold;">クラ急行</td>
                            <td style="font-size: 13px; color: var(--text-secondary);">コミュニティの出来事まとめ・記録</td>
                        </tr>
                    </tbody>
                </table>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
